{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4115450","name":"影之刃零","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/8eab9a04236256ac92450890ca82c459.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >蒙冤弑主，心脏受创，命余六十六日。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >形单影只，亡命天涯，江湖穿梭，誓破迷局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雨和血，恩与仇，交织一趟爱恨纵横的寻心之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/11eeb873043452d8f95e5fb0bc10aef4.poster.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/11eeb873043452d8f95e5fb0bc10aef4.webm?t=1793261976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/16ec7609e8c6ad1bdcfd77dfde6d1d8f.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索光影斑驳，悬疑诡秘的“影境”世界：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >记忆之花，表里武林，杀气改造，圣母娘娘，虚空梦境......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >秘闻环环相扣，轶事层出不穷。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >山重水复，踱步间柳暗花明；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >机关重重，回首望曲径通幽。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/fe8f60566e3c41a4bc03aa83f5bdbeff.poster.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/fe8f60566e3c41a4bc03aa83f5bdbeff.webm?t=1793261976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/0f1859062b072cd3326ddaf72a9a6054.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >江湖中，兵器如命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >三十余种主武器，二十多门奇诡武装，在刀光剑影间，从败者手中夺来。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >门派武学为根，无缝连击如魅，易上手却难窥堂奥，绝顶高手方知其中杀机重重。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刀剑交加，火星四溅，闪转腾挪，连消带打，胜败只在瞬息。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >谁知下一个转折，便是血染黄沙，还是绝处逢生？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/108a5a2bec42eea8085e1a306dae58d5.poster.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/108a5a2bec42eea8085e1a306dae58d5.webm?t=1793261976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/90a79604bd7bca516c8952902078ecee.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武侠电影黄金年代意象与朋克幻想元素激烈碰撞：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武侠秘籍、冷兵器、机械义肢、工业建筑残骸、中式古典与现代摇滚音乐......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >交相辉映，构筑成闻所未闻的“功夫朋克”暗黑美学。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/ac57a3430847c9024b8e68408cbad0e9.poster.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/ac57a3430847c9024b8e68408cbad0e9.webm?t=1793261976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/d2a4cc8e661e02512cb96f6bff7b95a9.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >借助虚幻5引擎与崭新动作捕捉技术，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >顶尖武侠电影武术指导联袂出演，一招一式皆脱胎于真实技击，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以电影化的演绎方式，再现中国功夫的不朽魅力！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/ae4458f3bce27d5d76288bb654ced727.poster.avif?t=1793261976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/extras/ae4458f3bce27d5d76288bb654ced727.webm?t=1793261976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115450/40b2044606b59e0cdd9fb89738895fea8a22067c/header_schinese.jpg?t=1793261976","website":"https://pbz.s-game.com/","developers":["S-GAME Studio"],"publishers":["S-GAME Publishing"],"release_date":"2026 年 10 月 28 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"SGD","initial":"69.90","final":"69.90","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 俄语, 日语, 繁体中文, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 韩语, 意大利语, 泰语, 越南语, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","可调整文字大小","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","推荐使用手柄","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","Steam 输入 API 支持","立体声","字幕选项","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</stron